{"id":"4b28706879995352","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md","title":"UTB 加全局反射推出全部统一算术反射","display":"thm-reflection-from-truth — UTB 加全局反射推出全部统一算术反射","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-reflection-from-truth","aliases":["91-thm-reflection-from-truth"],"display":"thm-reflection-from-truth — UTB 加全局反射推出全部统一算术反射","depends_on":["[[91-df-UTB]]","[[91-df-global-reflection]]","[[91-df-uniform-reflection]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-reflection-from-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-reflection-from-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-reflection-from-truth — UTB 加全局反射推出全部统一算术反射"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f215d3f10d33ae6\" href=\"?note=2f215d3f10d33ae6\" title=\"91-df-UTB\">91-df-UTB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"16b107dfee99998b\" href=\"?note=16b107dfee99998b\" title=\"91-df-global-reflection\">91-df-global-reflection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2126873bea8294ae\" href=\"?note=2126873bea8294ae\" title=\"91-df-uniform-reflection\">91-df-uniform-reflection</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{URF}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{URF}(S)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2126873bea8294ae\" href=\"?note=2126873bea8294ae\" title=\"91-df-uniform-reflection\">91-df-uniform-reflection</a> 的统一反射模式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为基础算术语言中的可递归公理化理论，证明谓词自然表示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{UTB}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S)\\})\">\\(U=\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{UTB}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S)\\})\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}from\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\nU\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\,[\\operatorname{Prov}_S(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec x))\\to\\varphi(\\vec x)],\n\\qquad\\mathrm{URF}(S)\\subseteq U.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}from\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\nU\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\,[\\operatorname{Prov}_S(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec x))\\to\\varphi(\\vec x)],\n\\qquad\\mathrm{URF}(S)\\subseteq U.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>基础算术证明逐参数数字代入所得为句子。把其编码代入全局反射，得到可证性推出对应真理原子；UTB 的统一双条件（闭项版本特别取数码项）再给出 T-out，从而推出所列统一实例。\n关键新增前提是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S)\\)</span>。UTB 本身即使带完整归纳仍对 PA 保守，不能把这一新增反射句悄悄当成 UTB 定理。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(S=\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span>，矛盾句实例给出 PA 一致性。</p>\n<p>来源：§22.1，印刷页 308–310，尤其印刷页 309–310，PDF 页 319–321。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-UTB","status":"resolved","id":"2f215d3f10d33ae6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-UTB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-global-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"16b107dfee99998b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-global-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-uniform-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"2126873bea8294ae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-uniform-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-uniform-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"2126873bea8294ae","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{URF}(S)$ 为 [[91-df-uniform-reflection]] 的统一反射模式。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{URF}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"U=\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{UTB}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S)\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}from\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\nU\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\,[\\operatorname{Prov}_S(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec x))\\to\\varphi(\\vec x)],\n\\qquad\\mathrm{URF}(S)\\subseteq U.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S)","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\mathrm{PA}","display":false}],"bytes":1585,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-146","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-151","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.